[
  {
    "content_id": "10055001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我保罗奉上帝的旨意，按照在基督耶稣里应许的生命做基督耶稣的使徒，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;写信给我亲爱的儿子提摩太。 愿父上帝和我们的主基督耶稣赐给你恩典、怜悯和平安！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我日夜不停地为你祷告，对我效法祖先用清洁的良心事奉的上帝充满了感恩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;每逢想起你流泪的情形，我就渴望见你，好使我的心充满喜乐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我记得你那真诚无伪的信心。你外祖母罗以和你母亲友妮基首先有了这信心，我深信你也有。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;因此我提醒你，要把上帝在我给你按手时赐给你的恩赐充分发挥出来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因为上帝赐给我们的不是怯懦的心，而是刚强、仁爱、自律的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;所以，你不要羞于为我们的主做见证，也不要以我这为主被囚的人为耻，要靠着上帝的能力和我一同为福音受苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;上帝拯救了我们，并呼召我们过圣洁的生活，不是因为我们的行为，而是出于祂的旨意和恩典。早在万古以前，祂就在基督耶稣里把这恩典赐给我们了，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;如今借着我们救主基督耶稣的降世显明了出来。基督已经消灭死亡，借着福音将不朽的生命彰显了出来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我为了这福音受委派做传道人、使徒和教师。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我因此遭受这些苦难，但我不以为耻，因为我知道我所信的是谁，也深信祂能保守祂所托付我的，一直到那日。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你要以在基督耶稣里的信心和爱心，把从我这里听到的纯正教导当作典范遵守，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;要靠着住在我们里面的圣灵牢牢守住交托给你的善道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你知道几乎所有亚细亚的人都离弃了我，其中包括腓吉路和黑摩其尼。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;愿主怜悯阿尼色弗一家人，他常常鼓励我，不以我被囚禁为耻。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;他在罗马的时候千方百计寻访我的下落，直到找着我为止。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;你清楚知道，他从前在以弗所怎样在各个方面服侍我。愿主再来时怜悯他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我儿啊！你要靠着基督耶稣的恩典刚强起来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;以前你在许多见证人面前听过我的教导，你要把这些教导传给忠信可靠、能教导他人的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你要做基督耶稣的精兵，与我同受苦难。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;当兵的若让其他事务缠身，就不能取悦征召他的上司。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;同样，参加比赛的人若不遵守比赛规则，就不可能得奖。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;辛劳的农夫理当先享受收成。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你要思想我说的话，因为主必使你领悟这一切。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你要切记我所传的福音：耶稣基督是大卫的后裔，祂从死里复活了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我为这福音受苦，甚至像犯人一样被囚禁，但上帝的道是囚禁不住的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我为了上帝的选民忍受一切痛苦，使他们可以获得在基督耶稣里的救恩和永远的荣耀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;有真实可信的话说： “我们若与基督同死， 就必与祂同活。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我们若忍耐到底， 就必与祂一同做王。 我们若不承认祂， 祂也必不承认我们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我们纵然会失信， 祂仍然信实可靠， 因为祂不能否认自己。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你要提醒众人这些事，在上帝面前嘱咐他们：不要为言词争辩，因为那对听见的人有害无益。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你应当竭力在上帝面前做经得起考验、问心无愧的工人，正确讲解真理之道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;要远避一切世俗的空谈，因为好空谈的人只会越来越不敬虔。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;他们讲的话像毒疮越烂越大，许米乃和腓理徒就是例子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;他们离经背道，说复活的事已成过去，动摇了一些人的信心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;然而，上帝所立的坚实根基屹立不摇，这根基上刻着：“主认识那些属于祂的人”，“凡承认主名的人都要离弃罪恶。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;大户人家不但有金器银器，也有木器瓦器，这些器皿的用途有贵贱之分。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;人若洁身自爱，远离卑贱的事，就必成为圣洁无瑕的贵重器皿，可以被主用来成就各种善事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;你要逃避年轻人的邪情私欲，要跟那些以清洁的心求告主的人一同追求公义、信心、仁爱、和平。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;不要参与愚昧无知的辩论，因为你知道这些事只会引起纷争。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;主的奴仆不可与人争执，总要温和待人，善于教导，心存忍耐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;要温柔地规劝那些反对的人，也许上帝会赐给他们悔改的心，使他们明白真理，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 2:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;让他们这些被魔鬼掳去、受其摆布的人能够醒悟过来，脱离魔鬼的网罗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你要知道，末世必有艰难的日子，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;因为那时的人都自私自利、贪爱钱财、狂妄自夸、骄傲自负、毁谤亵渎、违背父母、忘恩负义、心不圣洁、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;冷漠无情、不愿和解、好说谗言、毫无节制、蛮横凶暴、不爱良善、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;出卖朋友、任意妄为、自高自大、沉溺享乐、不爱上帝，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;徒有敬虔的外表，却无敬虔的实质。你要避开这样的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;这些人溜进别人家里，哄骗那些意志薄弱的妇女。那些妇女心中充满罪恶，受各种邪情私欲驱使，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;虽然常常学习，却始终不能明白真理。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;现在这些人敌对真理，就像从前雅尼和佯庇反对摩西一样，他们的心思坏透了，他们的信仰是虚假的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;不过，他们猖狂不了多久，因为他们的愚昧行径必暴露在众人面前，就像雅尼和佯庇的下场一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;但你熟知我的教导、言行、志向、信心、忍耐、爱心、毅力，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;也知道我在安提阿、以哥念、路司得遭遇了何等的迫害和苦难。但主从这一切患难中救了我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;其实凡立志在基督耶稣里过敬虔生活的人都会受到迫害。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;而恶人和骗子会变本加厉地作恶，迷惑人，也被人迷惑。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;但你要坚守自己所学所信的，因为你知道是跟谁学的，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;并且你从小就熟悉圣经。圣经能给你智慧，使你借着信基督耶稣而得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;圣经全部是上帝启示的，有益于教导、督责、使人归正、培养人行义，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;使属上帝的人得到充分的装备，去行各种善事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;在上帝和审判活人死人的基督耶稣面前，我凭基督的显现和祂的国郑重嘱咐你：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;务要传道，无论时机好坏，都要准备好，以百般的忍耐和教导督责人、警戒人、勉励人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因为有一天，人们会厌倦纯正的教导，耳朵发痒，寻找许多迎合他们私欲的老师。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他们掩耳不听真理，反而偏向无稽之谈。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;然而，你要谨慎行事，不怕吃苦，专心传道，尽忠职守。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我的生命如同奉献在祭坛上的酒正倾倒出来，我离世的日子快要到了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;那美好的仗，我打过了；当跑的路，我跑完了；所信的道，我守住了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;从此，有公义的冠冕为我预备，按公义审判的主会在祂来的那一天把它赐给我，不但会赐给我，也会赐给所有爱慕祂显现的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;请你尽快到我这里来，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;因为底马贪爱世界，离弃我跑到帖撒罗尼迦去了。革勒士去了加拉太，提多去了挞马太，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;只剩下路加一人在我身边。你要把马可一起带来，因为他在传道的工作上对我很有帮助。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;至于推基古，我派他到以弗所去了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你来的时候，要把我在特罗亚时留给加布的外衣带来，也要带来那些书卷，特别是那些羊皮卷。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;铜匠亚历山大做了许多恶事害我，主必按他的所作所为报应他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你也要提防他，因为他极力反对我们所传的道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我第一次在法庭申辩的时候，没有人帮助我，众人都离弃了我，但愿他们不会因此而获罪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;然而主站在我身旁加给我力量，使我可以把福音完整地传给所有的外族人。主把我从狮子口里救了出来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;主必救我脱离一切邪恶的攻击，带我进入祂的天国。愿荣耀归给主，直到永永远远。阿们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;请代我问候百基拉和亚居拉，以及阿尼色弗一家。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;以拉都留在了哥林多，我把生病的特罗非摩留在了米利都。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你要尽快在冬天之前赶到这里来。友布罗、布田、利奴、革劳底亚和众弟兄姊妹都问候你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太后书 4:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;愿主与你的灵同在！愿恩典与你们同在！</p>"
  }
]